--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 275091b99b7eacd40a40ec48225b80b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_MayorStart
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  dialogueID: 300
  lines:
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: Who is this? Oh you are a vistior. Welcome!
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: Oh you met the colck maker and collected the gears I wanted
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: Thats great. You really have a good heart
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: What brings you here?
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: Oh you received a letter. Thats strange we didn;t send any letter
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: We have seen many strange events after the tower broken down
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: If you want to you can visit the tower. But for that you need the key
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: I can give it now. But can you help me with the records in my table
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: Its piling up a lot and I am really tired. As I am the only one who works
      on this
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: You just need to arrange some records with some value in the box
  - speakerName: Mayor
    portrait: {fileID: 424516655, guid: ec375931c4f9874488351aac5b5cbf1c, type: 3}
    text: After this you can go to the tower and visit it
